{"title":"Seniors Pancyprian Problems and Solutions","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Seniors_Pancyprian_Competition\" title=\"Seniors Pancyprian Competition\">Seniors Pancyprian Competition</a> problems and solutions by year:\n</p><p><b>Note:</b> Until 2003 2nd and 3rd grade had common papers. As of 2004 each grade (1st, 2nd, 3rd) has its own different paper.\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_Seniors_Pancyprian\" title=\"2004 Seniors Pancyprian\">2004 Seniors Pancyprian</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_Seniors_Pancyprian\" title=\"2005 Seniors Pancyprian\">2005 Seniors Pancyprian</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_Seniors_Pancyprian\" title=\"2006 Seniors Pancyprian\">2006 Seniors Pancyprian</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_Seniors_Pancyprian\" title=\"2007 Seniors Pancyprian\">2007 Seniors Pancyprian</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_Seniors_Pancyprian&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2008 Seniors Pancyprian (page does not exist)\">2008 Seniors Pancyprian</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_Seniors_Pancyprian&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2009 Seniors Pancyprian (page does not exist)\">2009 Seniors Pancyprian</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_Seniors_Pancyprian&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2010 Seniors Pancyprian (page does not exist)\">2010 Seniors Pancyprian</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_Seniors_Pancyprian&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2011 Seniors Pancyprian (page does not exist)\">2011 Seniors Pancyprian</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_Seniors_Pancyprian&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2012 Seniors Pancyprian (page does not exist)\">2012 Seniors Pancyprian</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?